[[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Position the cylinder head (1a) in the vice using the supporting\ntool (1b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>A stud must be removed from the\ncylinder head to allow the tool (1b) to be fitted.</p></aside><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Support</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.470.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044180.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) for the timing driven pulley, using the tools\n(1b) and (1c) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Support for counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Spanner for camshaft pulley rotation</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.002</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Check that the camshaft end float is within\nthe recommended values using a dial gauge on a magnetic base.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044181.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>End float (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.10 - 0.20</p></td></tr></table></div><p>If the end float is not within the recommended\nvalues, replace the worn components when refitting.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the camshaft bearings (1b) lubrication\npipe.</p><p>2. Undo the remaining bolts (2a) and remove the camshaft caps (2b).</p><p>3. Remove the camshaft.</p><p>4. Remove the camshaft front oil seal.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044182.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the camshaft to the cylinder head.</p><p>1. Fit the camshaft caps (1a) and the camshaft bearing (1b) lubrication\npipe and secure it tightening the bolts (1c) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAMSHAFT CAPS</p></td><td><p>M8 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CAMSHAFT OIL SEAL</p></td><td><p>M6 x 1</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1</p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Fit the camshaft front oil seal (2a) using the tool (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.882.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Fit the timing driven pulley (3a) and secure it tightening the\nbolt (3b) to the recommended torque using tool (3c) supported by\ntool (3d) for counter-torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>TIMING GEAR DRIVEN PULLEYS</p></td><td><p>M10 x 1.25</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>7</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3c</p></td><td><p>Spanner for camshaft pulley rotation</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.002</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3d</p></td><td><p>Support for counter-torque</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.831.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044183.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Check that the valve clearance, with the valves in the closed\nposition, is within the recommended values.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Inlet valve clearance (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.40 ± 0.05</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Exhaust valve clearance (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.45 ± 0.05</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044184.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>If the valve clearance measured is not\nwithin the recommended values, replace the tappet adjustment shims\nas described below.</p><p>1. Lower the tappet in question using tool (1a) and keep it lowered\nusing tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Lever</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.443.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Lever</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.747.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044185.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>1. Extract the tappet adjustment shim (1a) using the tool (1b) and\nreplace it with one of a suitable size.</p><p>2. Remove the tool for keeping the tappets lowered.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Pliers</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.887.001.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Lever</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.747.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2044186.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,1,0,"<p>Remove the cylinder head from the support\ntool and reposition the latter.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Support</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.470.000</p></td></tr></table></div>"]]